{"server":"cn","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_05_beg","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_05","title":"别阻止我","storyCode":"OF-5","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"8d8b2587810c7b6421477bd97cfd4e34f82f1e099fcdd19a45c2a32d197189f9","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"广播塔下，黑已经等待多时，但是她立刻发现，锡兰不过是诱饵。\n而另一边，红豆和博士顺利进入了市政厅。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sunnytown_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都有没有热火朝天地嗨起来？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为了迎接黑曜石节最盛大的晚会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"从今天的12点起，各大商场、游乐设施，以及部分餐厅、酒吧都将举行限时的预热活动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"千万不要错过这些最盛大的宴会！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Festival_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"你果然会来这里，小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"黑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定会来这里。在被克洛宁拒绝以后，你想用广播塔散布信息，让全城人听到你的报告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"这行不通，小姐，这只会带来更大的混乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"也许你讨厌你的父亲，也讨厌这个城市，但老爷已经付出得够多了。黑曜石节和这个城市会因此分崩离析。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道我的报告会引起轩然大波，也会引发许多后果，但大家都有权知道真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道老爷的过错。老爷为了这座城市做了很多不好的事情，只是没有这些事，根本不会有汐斯塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"这次完全不一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"如果小姐觉得不能解气的话，批评我就可以了，请不要做出些没法挽救的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你是不是觉得我还在耍小孩子脾气？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"不，小姐。我可以和你一起慢慢说服老爷，我保证。只是现在，请跟我回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"黑......别这么说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"我理解你和老爷之间有许多不快，但你应该先回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么说话！我知道你想让我和爸爸之间的关系缓和一些，但你能不能不要是现在这个样子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么就不能像以前一样呢，就像以前一样，像朋友一样和我说话啊，黑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是道尔科斯家的仆人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想你这么说，黑。我不要听你这么说！怎么会变成这样的，你为什么会变成这个样子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你还犹豫些什么？快把她抓起来啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"——她是道尔科斯家的女儿。别太僭越。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"但市长已经要你全力协助克洛宁先生了！你要看着她散布谣言，毁掉整个汐斯塔吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"......用用你的脑子。她一个人在这里，没有表现出哪怕一丁点的焦躁，甚至......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得她真的想进入广播塔吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，你在把自己当成诱饵吸引我，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"......你还是了解我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"我不敢这么说，小姐。只不过你没有否认我的猜测，我可以下结论了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡兰","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"现在这个时候，罗德岛应该已经出现在市政厅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁的手下","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么？这可不在我们的计划里啊！市政厅那边现在是什么情况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得，那群酒囊饭袋，现在大概正被打得四处乱窜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁的保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"外面怎么没声音了？不是让他们赶紧把材料搬走，这么急的事情怎么还能偷懒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁的保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？刚才那阵叫骂，难道又有人打架了？不管了，赶紧把手上的处理——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先生，请开门！我们是来送快递的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁的保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯？你们没人要收什么东西吧？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁的保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"（都没有？奇怪......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁的保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"你送错地方了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是先生，这个快递就是写着送到这里的啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁的保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"走开！再缠着我们，小心棍棒不长眼睛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁的保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，臭小鬼，肯定又是来骗钱的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎不管了！博士，站旁边些，我来把这东西踹开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女孩的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么？没关系的！这点力气我还是有的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁的保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛宁的保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊啊？！大门怎么倒了，我的天，你是什么——"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"漂亮的一脚！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"朋友，可不能粗鲁对待快递员啊。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，我早就想这么试试了。接下来我要试试这句话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，咳咳，哼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"“开门！快递！”"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这不是已经被你踢开了吗！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_290_vigna","aliases":["红豆"]},{"speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","aliases":["黑"]},{"speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","aliases":["锡兰"]}]}
